  <History Date="22-08-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Silver Star Pluto 200 (SS658SC).  Charts only.  No product name available." />
  <History Date="10-09-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed CTO from fixed ranges to one single variable range in response to manufacturer request." />
  <History Date="15-10-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest charts (just dimmer change to 8bit in basic mode).  Changed name from SS660SC to Pluto 600 (SS660SC)" />
  <History Date="15-10-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail" />
  <History Date="18-10-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added default RDM personality and software ID's for compatibility." />
  <History Date="05-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised animation ranges in line with latest charts in response to manufacturer request." />
  <History Date="05-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed CTO to default at 6800K (0 DMX)" />
